        "titolo_orig": "Trade, Iran and Taiwan on the agenda as Trump arrives in China for high-stakes talks with Xi",
        "testo_it": "Il presidente USA Trump arriva a Pechino per colloqui cruciali su commercio, Iran e Taiwan con Xi Jinping.",
