        "link": "https://www.france24.com/en/trade-tech-and-rare-earths-to-dominate-trump-s-china-trip",
        "orario": "23:23 - 13 Maggio",
        "timestamp": 1778707382,
        "contenuto_esteso": "More than a dozen executives from the world's largest companies have joined US President Donald Trump on a high-stakes visit to China. The business delegation points to an agenda dominated by trade, technology, and rare earths. The minerals are the building block of many modern industries, and a source of economic leverage for Beijing. Also in the show - the US Senate approves Kevin Warsh to be the next Chairman of the Federal Reserve."
